        desc = "DOEPDMABN is a DMA buffer address register for device OUT endpoint n.

Data sheet 12.7.5.2 DOEPDMABN (offset 0xB1C, printed page 12-243, `Hi3518EV20X-Hi3516CV200-Datasheet.txt` line 90646).";

        field {
